			"Message": "chore(Land): Make maintenance scripts executable and update dependencies\n\nMake all shell scripts in Maintain/ executable (755) to ensure proper execution during build and development workflows. Update devDependencies to latest versions: @biomejs/biome 2.4.10, @prettier/plugin-php 0.25.0, prettier-plugin-pkg 0.22.1, and turbo 2.9.1.\n\nThese updates bring latest bug fixes and performance improvements from the tooling ecosystem.",
